{"item_uid": "指考95-math_yi-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "math_yi", "subject_zh": "數學乙", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(單選題、多選題及選填題共佔74分)", "stem": "在坐標平面上，選出與圓 (x−3)2 +(y−4)2 =52 相切的直線：\n(1) 3x+4y=5\n(2) 3x+4y=0\n(3) 4x+3y=5\n(4) 4x+3y=0\n(5) 4x+3y=1", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 7.0, "2": 59.0, "3": 6.0, "4": 7.0, "5": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 1.0, "2": 93.0, "3": 1.0, "4": 2.0, "5": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 13.0, "2": 24.0, "3": 14.0, "4": 12.0, "5": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 16.0, "p_value": 59.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 23.0, "discrimination": 70.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 83.0, 61.0, 36.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-math_yi-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "math_yi", "subject_zh": "數學乙", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(單選題、多選題及選填題共佔74分)", "stem": "某大學數學系甄選入學的篩選方式如下：\n先就學科能力測驗國文、英文和社會這三科成績（級分）加總做第一次篩選。\n然後從通過篩選的學生當中，以自然科的成績做第二次篩選。\n最後再從通過的學生當中，以數學科的成績做第三次篩選，選出一些學生參\n加面試。\n現在有五位報名該系的學生的學科能力測驗成績如下表：\n學生 國文級分 英文級分 數學級分 社會級分 自然級分\n甲 13 8 14 15 11\n乙 12 12 12 12 12\n丙 9 13 15 8 15\n丁 11 12 13 10 13\n戊 13 15 11 7 12\n已知這五位學生當中，通過第一次篩選的有四位，通過第二次篩選的有三\n位，通過第三次篩選可以參加面試的只剩下一位。請問哪一位學生參加面\n試？\n(1) 甲 (2) 乙 (3) 丙 (4) 丁 (5) 戊\n-1-\n95年指考 第 2 頁\n數 學 乙 共 6 頁\n(cid:75) (cid:75) (cid:75) (cid:75) (cid:75)", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 3.0, "2": 5.0, "3": 12.0, "4": 78.0, "5": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 1.0, "2": 2.0, "3": 7.0, "4": 90.0, "5": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 7.0, "2": 9.0, "3": 16.0, "4": 66.0, "5": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 78.0, "p_high": 90.0, "p_low": 66.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 83.0, 80.0, 76.0, 59.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-math_yi-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "math_yi", "subject_zh": "數學乙", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(單選題、多選題及選填題共佔74分)", "stem": "假設 a,b,c 是空間中三個向量， r 是一個實數。已知 a=(1,1,0), b=(0,1,1) 且\n(cid:75) (cid:75) (cid:75) (cid:75) (cid:75) (cid:75) (cid:75)\na,b,c 滿足 a+b+rc=0，那麼 r 不可能等於下列哪一個數值：\n(1) − 2\n(2) 0\n(3) 1\n(4) π （圓周率）\n(5) 10100", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 5.0, "2": 62.0, "3": 2.0, "4": 5.0, "5": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 1.0, "2": 94.0, "3": 0.0, "4": 2.0, "5": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 12.0, "2": 26.0, "3": 6.0, "4": 9.0, "5": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 24.0, "p_value": 62.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 69.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 86.0, 67.0, 42.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-math_yi-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "math_yi", "subject_zh": "數學乙", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(單選題、多選題及選填題共佔74分)", "stem": "嘌呤是構成人體基因的重要物質，它的化學結構式主要是由一個正五邊形與\n一個正六邊形構成（令它們的邊長均為 1）的平面圖形，如下圖所示：\n試問以下哪些選項是正確的？\n(1) ∠BAC =54°\n(2) O 是 ∆ABC 的外接圓圓心\n(3) AB= 3\n(4) BC =2sin66°\n-2-\n第 3 頁 95年指考\n共 6 頁 數 學 乙", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 9.0, "2": 81.0, "3": 73.0, "4": 50.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 1.0, "2": 96.0, "3": 95.0, "4": 64.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 22.0, "2": 63.0, "3": 48.0, "4": 44.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 53.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 64.0, 51.0, 39.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-math_yi-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "math_yi", "subject_zh": "數學乙", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(單選題、多選題及選填題共佔74分)", "stem": "一個「訊息」是由一串5 個數字排列組成，且每位數字都只能是0 或1，例如\n10010 與01011 就是兩個不同的訊息。兩個訊息的「距離」定義為此兩組數\n字串相對應位置中，數字不同的位置數。例如，數字串10010 與01011 在第\n1, 2 及5 三個位置不同，所以訊息10010 與01011 的距離為3。\n試問以下哪些選項是正確的？\n(1) 與訊息10010 相距最遠的訊息為11101\n(2) 任兩訊息之間的最大可能距離是4\n(3) 與訊息10010 相距為1 的訊息恰有5 個\n(4) 與訊息10010 相距為2 的訊息恰有9 個", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 8.0, "2": 11.0, "3": 88.0, "4": 25.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 1.0, "2": 2.0, "3": 99.0, "4": 11.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 18.0, "2": 22.0, "3": 75.0, "4": 38.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 42.0, "discrimination": 50.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 84.0, 73.0, 61.0, 31.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-math_yi-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "math_yi", "subject_zh": "數學乙", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(單選題、多選題及選填題共佔74分)", "stem": "一個函數繪圖軟體的視窗預設的坐標平面之可視範圍為 −15≤x≤15 及\n−10≤ y≤10 ，如下圖所示：\n當我們把視窗的比例尺調整為原來的二分之一時，視窗的可視範圍變成\n−30≤x≤30 及 −20≤ y≤20，如下圖所示：\n試問以下哪些選項是正確的？\n(1) 如果把視窗的比例尺調整為原來的三分之一，那麼視窗的可視範圍變成\n−45≤x≤45 及 −30≤ y≤30；\n(2) 如果把視窗的比例尺調整為原來的二分之一，那麼坐標平面上任一直線\n的斜率也變成原來的二分之一；\n(3) 使用預設的視窗時，只能看到 y= x2 −30x+190 與 y=5x−60 這兩個圖形的\n一個交點；\n(4) 如果把視窗的比例尺調整為原來的五分之一，就可以看到 y= x2 −30x+190\n與 y=5x−60 這兩個圖形所有的交點。\n-3-\n95年指考 第 4 頁\n數 學 乙 共 6 頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 88.0, "2": 7.0, "3": 68.0, "4": 44.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 99.0, "2": 0.0, "3": 92.0, "4": 31.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 73.0, "2": 18.0, "3": 43.0, "4": 48.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 53.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [86.0, 67.0, 54.0, 41.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考95-math_yi-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 95, "year_ce": 2006, "subject_key": "math_yi", "subject_zh": "數學乙", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(單選題、多選題及選填題共佔74分)", "stem": "某次數學測驗分為選擇題與非選擇題兩部分。下列的散佈圖中每個點 (X,Y)\n分別代表一位學生於此兩部分的得分，其中 X 表該生選擇題的得分， Y 表\n該生非選擇題的得分。設\nZ = X +Y\n為各生在該測驗的總分。共有11 位學生的得分數據。\n試問以下哪些選項是正確的？\n(1) X 的中位數 > Y 的中位數\n(2) X 的標準差 > Y 的標準差\n(3) X 的全距 > Y 的全距\n(4) Z 的中位數= X 的中位數+ Y 的中位數\n-4-\n第 5 頁 95年指考\n共 6 頁 數 學 乙", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 80.0, "2": 73.0, "3": 86.0, "4": 35.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 94.0, "2": 92.0, "3": 98.0, "4": 22.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 64.0, "2": 53.0, "3": 69.0, "4": 47.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 55.0, "p_high": 81.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 56.0, "p_quintiles": [87.0, 70.0, 57.0, 45.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
